<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Auth0 Symfony SDK - Sample App</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; color: #333; }
        h1 { color: #635dff; }
        a { color: #635dff; text-decoration: none; }
        a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        .navbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .navbar .brand { font-weight: 600; color: #635dff; font-size: 1.1em; }
        .navbar .auth { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
        .navbar .auth img { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.9em; }
        .btn-primary { background: #635dff; color: #fff; }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: #4f49e0; text-decoration: none; }
        .btn-outline { border: 1px solid #635dff; color: #635dff; }
        .btn-outline:hover { background: #f0eeff; text-decoration: none; }
        .card { border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 16px 0; }
        .card h3 { margin-top: 0; }
        code { background: #f4f4f4; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar">
        <span class="brand">Auth0 Symfony SDK</span>
        <div class="auth">
            {% if session %}
                {% if session.user.picture is defined %}
                    <img src="{{ session.user.picture }}" alt="">
                {% endif %}
                <span>{{ session.user.name ?? session.user.email ?? 'User' }}</span>
                <a href="/private" class="btn btn-outline">Profile</a>
                <a href="/logout" class="btn btn-outline">Logout</a>
            {% else %}
                <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">Login</a>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </nav>

    <h1>Sample App</h1>
    <p>This app demonstrates authenticating users, authorizing API requests, and calling the Management API with the Auth0 Symfony SDK.</p>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>Authentication</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="/login">Login</a> - begin Auth0 login flow</li>
            <li><a href="/private">Profile</a> - protected page (requires auth)</li>
            <li><a href="/logout">Logout</a> - end session</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>API Authorization</h3>
        <p>Uncomment the <code>audiences</code> array in <code>config/packages/auth0.yaml</code> to use these routes.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="/api">Public API</a> - no auth needed</li>
            <li><a href="/api/private">Private API</a> - requires valid token</li>
            <li><a href="/api/scoped">Scoped API</a> - requires <code>read:messages</code> scope</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>Management API</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="/management">Management Explorer</a> - iterate through Management API endpoints via the bundle's <code>getManagement()</code> accessor</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
